    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the kitchen, Max is bored and looking for a distraction. He approaches Chef Victor and curiously asks about the special dish the chef is preparing, but Victor quickly shuts him down. Let us listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Что тебе надо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А что вы готовите?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "А тебе какое дело?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Тебе нечем заняться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "У меня есть пять минут.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я хотел поучиться у вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Иди работай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А можно попробовать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Нет, нельзя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Почему?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Потому что я так сказал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ладно, я понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Тогда иди отсюда.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef.' — Built around the key proper name meaning 'chef, boss'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Что тебе надо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you need?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'what' paired with the pronoun for 'for you, to you'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А что вы готовите?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what are you preparing?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'what' paired with the pronoun for 'you'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "А тебе какое дело?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what is it to you?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'for you, to you' paired with the adjective for 'what a'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Тебе нечем заняться?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have nothing to do?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'for you, to you' paired with the noun for 'nothing (to do it with)'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "У меня есть пять минут.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have five minutes.' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'me' paired with the verb for 'there is (   = I have)'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я хотел поучиться у вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to learn from you.' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'I' paired with the verb for 'wanted'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Иди работай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go work.' — Notice the verb meaning 'go' paired with the verb for 'work'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А можно попробовать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And can I try it?' — Notice the adverb meaning 'may, can' paired with the verb for 'to taste'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Нет, нельзя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, you cannot.' — Built around the key adverb meaning 'not allowed, can't'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Почему?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why?' — Built around the key adverb meaning 'why'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Потому что я так сказал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I said so.' — Notice the adverb meaning 'because (with )' paired with the pronoun for 'what'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ладно, я понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I understand.' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'I' paired with the verb for 'understood? (got it?)'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Тогда иди отсюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then go from here.' — Notice the adverb meaning 'back then' paired with the verb for 'go'. Now let us listen to the conversation once again.",
